# "Up to one target": Bot1 chooses no target for the enters trigger (`Target()`), so nothing is exiled and no Clue is made:
# the Hired Blade stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Hired Blade
Stab
Raven Eagle
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x14

[Actions]
